  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From Training to Action: Empowering CSOs to Launch Rights-Based Advocacy Campaigns in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enable 16 CSO leaders from all 14 regions and the Republic of Karakalpakstan to design and implement safe, lawful, rights-based campaigns with mentoring and small-grant support. Specifically, the training will focus on freedom of association with an emphasis on labour rights, delivered through a gender-inclusive approach and translated into community-level actions.</narrative>
  </description>
